---
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-array-to-pointer-decay,
  -readability-identifier-length
WarningsAsErrors: 'bugprone-*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '^(src|include)/'
FormatStyle: file
...
